[Music]  summer is the season when classic and  vintage cars really get the shine and  Germany these older models are becoming  increasingly popular over the last nine  years the number of cars licensed as  historical vehicles has increased by  almost a quarter of a million today the  classic and vintage car club old-timer  club line EFT is holding a get-together  it's an event the whole family can enjoy  [Music]  one by one the cars set off and make  their way to the group picnic  everything from Rolls Royces to Mercedes  and BMWs some are very rare like this  Porsche 356 speedster it was the car  makers first series production vehicle  but here even cars that aren't  collectors items have their day in the  Sun plenty of these vehicles are worth a  second glance because all brands of cars  are welcome at the line Ave Club the  diversity is great these cars represent  a half a century of automotive history  [Music]  the old cars get a break while they wait  for the entire convoy to arrive in the  meantime the drivers and passengers  enjoy some food and refreshments mon  fiducial has arrived in his 1962 Rolls  Royce Silver Cloud he says they have  excursions like this twice a year it's a  tradition but Bushell feels the nicest  thing about them is the community as you  can see behind him folks sit together  chat and enjoy a potluck lunch and talk  about cars and everything under the Sun  gives them a boost if they've had a hard  week and work in on a stressful business  trip or having it rough as a retiree  this 50 year old Mercedes 250 SL is also  taking part in the excursion its owner  dirk organ really enjoys the club's  picnics  he feels they're important because they  promote the sense of community within  the club though they all know one  another these are experiences that stay  with you for a long time others collect  watches their common obsession is old  cars  whether they're passionate collectors  hobby mechanics or just want to drive  one of the cars from their childhood the  passion for old cars unites all kinds of  people and they enjoy different aspects  of these get-togethers this man says  it's great to spend the day with other  club members and take the family along  as they're not always at the clubs  evening meetings others take full  advantage of the chance to talk shop  this car buff says what's most important  to him is being around like-minded  individuals here he can pursue his hobby  without reservation and without worrying  about talking everyone's ear on March  10th Anita says his family's not always  so understanding when he talks about  cars non-stop but his buddies at the  club can't get enough so it's great to  chat with them Dagmar Peretz was happy  enough to have someone else drive her to  todays picnic she enjoys the camaraderie  especially talking to the wives and  girlfriends of the club's predominantly  male members she says it's nice to eat  and chat with them and talk about things  other than cars  but the rhein AFT antique car club  doesn't just organize these  get-togethers for the owners benefit it  also does it for the cars they need  regular workouts fiducial says the older  the car the more often things go wrong  with it these cars need to be driven but  then of course things can't happen  but if you don't use them even more can  go wrong cars go kaput just from  standing around at a club you meet  others with similar problems who know  how to solve them here you can find help  for the club's members owning a classic  or vintage model is about more than just  having a nice old car to call your own  it's about being part of a community of  like-minded people people who are all  crazy about old cars  [Music]

